    "title": "Twenty Thousand Leagues Under the Sea",
    "description": "Professor Aronnax joins a search for a sea monster. With Conseil and Ned Land, he discovers Captain Nemo's submarine, the Nautilus. They become prisoners aboard it. Under the sea, they find strange animals, beautiful places and danger. Aronnax wants to explore. Ned Land wants to escape.\n\nAn English adaptation for readers around CEFR A2+. It contains 52 chapters with English summaries. Nautical and scientific words may need extra attention. The novel includes historical ideas about nature and science. Final publishing checks remain pending.",
